2. Why Skills matter in this system

Set up once, reuse many times. No more copy-pasting the same profile and instructions. More consistent outputs across sessions and users. Lets them build a small library of "AI workers" for specific jobs.

3. How to create a Skill

Use a "Skill-Creator" skill to build new skills systematically.

